{
 "id": "5eacacb1-cc52-40eb-85c1-921fb9b431fa",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Seijo wa Oshi Katsu ga Shitai! Shiitagerare Reijou desu ga Oshi no Ouji-sama kara Dekiai Sareteimasu!?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生聖女は推し活がしたい！虐げられ令嬢ですが推しの王子様から溺愛されています！？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Due to an accident, the main character was reincarnated as Duchess Elysia, but because of her black hair and black eyes, she was despised as the \"daughter of evil\". One day, she meets the crown prince Reichelt who she decides to stan in this life. Though she is the saint, if she uses her stanning as a ways to motivate herself and it doesn't get found out, then there's no problem! She is so devoted to stanning him that she doesn't even realize that she's being doted on by her fave?!",
   "ja": "推し活中の事故で、公爵令嬢エリシアに転生をした主人公は黒髪黒目のせいで、「邪悪の娘」と蔑まれる日々を送っていた。聖女の力を隠し、日陰で生きていこうと心に決めたエリシアだったが王城で王太子レイシェルトに助けられ――\n\n「私、この世界でも推し様を見つけました！」\n\n推し活代を稼ぐため、こっそりまじない師を始めると店にレイシェルトの声にそっくりの男性がやってきて!? 推し活に励み過ぎて、推しからの溺愛に気が付かない！？"
  },
